empts\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Search-stage evaluator output (quoted from log; no registry entry beyond the 0.4993 total) for the studied configuration: crowd 0.9987, expert 0.0, flip rate 0.5, random reference 0.0695, influence reference 0.4993, mean budget fraction 0.5007, control gap 0.3153; total scores of all three configurations 0.4993 with runtimes about 1.3 s, 2.0 s, 114 s; configurations 2 and 3 identified by title only. Only aggregates are recorded: the studied configuration's aggregate 0.4993 equals the logged aggregate influence-only reference 0.4993; no per-case development budgets are recorded.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.best_correct_score\",\n        \"result.top_program_01\",\n        \"result.top_program_02\",\n        \"result.top_program_03\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Neither expert case flipped within the 68-row cap while both crowd cases flipped; the crowd cases together needed three rows on average (derived from crowd score 0.9987 and cap 1,150); cause of expert non-flip unknown.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.best_correct_score\",\n        \"study.search_score\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"The starting baseline was not run on held-out tables; selected configuration equals the baseline's development score.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"study.baseline_score\",\n        \"study.search_score_delta\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"citation_keys\": [\n        \"Davidson1970OnET\",\n        \"Davidson1977OnET\",\n        \"Davidson1969MultivariatePC\",\n        \"Causeur2005A2E\",\n        \"Stern2011ModeratedPC\",\n        \"Fageot2023GeneralizedBM\",\n        \"Yan2025InferenceIA\",\n        \"Yan2011GROUPEDSP\",\n        \"Leonard1977AnAB\",\n        \"Hussain2013BayesianIO\",\n        \"Rizvi2026BayesianBF\",\n        \"Butler2004TheEO\",\n        \"Bong2021GeneralizedRF\",\n        \"Varin2024TractableRR\",\n        \"Vojnovi\\u01072019Convergence